  "text": "Information - クロスフォー Information Development IR Information Language English 日本語 中文 Language 日本語 ✔ English 中文 Information Development IR Information BRAND SITE Crossfor for Business ONLINE STORE HOME About Us About Us What is Crossfor Crossfor is a jewelry manufacturer established in Kofu City, Yamanashi Prefecture, Japan in 1980. Under the corporate philosophy of continuing to be individuals and a socially responsible corporate entity, we are commited to creating a wide variety of products to make customers around the world smile. Message from the President Crossfor's mission is to deliver delightful surprises and joy to people around the world by creating new jewelry Philosophy Crossfor's corporate philosophy Company Outline Crossfor's business details, access information, and contact information History & Social Activity Crossfor's milestones since its founding and social activities RJC Compliance ▶ KYC Policy and Procedures、 Supply Chain Policy is available here. Contact Us Please feel free to contact us if you are interested in our company. 企業情報 代表挨拶 企業理念 企業概要 企業沿革 開発技術紹介 クロスフォーが持つ技術について 品質管理について OEMについて OEM活用事例 NEWS 採用情報 お問い合わせ よくあるご質問 プライバシーポリシー Copyright © 2020 Crossfor Co.,Ltd. All rights Reserved.",
